 "admission_checked_at": "2026-11-19",
 "intro_zh": "皇城相府是清文渊阁大学士兼吏部尚书加三级、《康熙字典》总阅官、康熙皇帝经筵讲官、一代名相陈廷敬的故居，总面积10万平方米。御书楼金碧辉煌，中道庄巍峨壮观，斗筑居府院连绵，河山楼雄伟险峻，藏兵洞层叠奇妙，是一处罕见的明清两代城堡式官宅民居建筑群。",
 "intro_en": "The Imperial City Prime Minister's Mansion is the former residence of Chen Tingjing, a bachelor of the Wenyuan Pavilion of the Qing Dynasty, a third-level minister of the Ministry of Civil Affairs, the chief reader of the Kangxi Dictionary, a banquet lecturer for Emperor Kangxi, and a famous prime minister of the generation, with a total area of ​​100,000 square meters. The Royal Book Building is magnificent, the Zhongdaozhuang is majestic, the Douzhu Palace is continuous, the Heshan Tower is majestic and precipitous, and the Tibetan Soldier Cave is layered with wonders. It is a rare castle-style official residence and residential complex from the Ming and Qing dynasties.",
 "intro_en_source": "machine_translation",
